{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Stickman: Waves of Doom</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to dive into chaos!<br><strong>Stickman: Waves of Doom</strong> is a <i>horde survivor game</i>\u00a0with minimalistic graphics where endless enemies crash down upon you in waves of pure chaos and destruction while maintaining steady FPS.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Survive the Onslaught</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two brutal stages. Countless enemies.<br>Every run is a desperate fight for survival as hordes of foes swarm from every direction. Each minute, the hordes grows stronger \u2014 and deadlier.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Fight, Die, Upgrade, Repeat</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 Playable Heroes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Temporary Upgrades</strong> \u2014 every run, adapt your build on the fly with powerful upgrades, new weapons and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Unlocks</strong> \u2014 after each death, spend your hard-earned coins to invest in permanent upgrades like more health, speed and shield.\u00a0</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Bosses &amp; Enemy Variety</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against <strong>bosses</strong> and a wide range of enemy types.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horde-survivor action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two challenging stages with unique themes and enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic upgrade system with temporary and permanent progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple bosses to defeat \u2014 each deadlier than the last</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, satisfying combat and stylized stickman visuals</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made with: Unity 6000.0.60f1</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4113990?t=1769101106","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4113990?t=1769101106","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113990/422854d41b3f1075e5ffda7df77e8e9b1a6b58fa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769101106","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113990/422854d41b3f1075e5ffda7df77e8e9b1a6b58fa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769101106","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Stickman: Waves of Doom</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to dive into chaos!<br><strong>Stickman: Waves of Doom</strong> is a <i>horde survivor game</i>\u00a0with minimalistic graphics where endless enemies crash down upon you in waves of pure chaos and destruction while maintaining steady FPS.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Survive the Onslaught</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two brutal stages. Countless enemies.<br>Every run is a desperate fight for survival as hordes of foes swarm from every direction. Each minute, the hordes grows stronger \u2014 and deadlier.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Fight, Die, Upgrade, Repeat</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 Playable Heroes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Temporary Upgrades</strong> \u2014 every run, adapt your build on the fly with powerful upgrades, new weapons and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Unlocks</strong> \u2014 aft